delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/jobs/:id
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
}

docs {
  ### Delete Job
  Deletes an existing job. The user must be the owner of the job.
  
  > [!IMPORTANT]
  > Before deletion, the service checks if there are associated proposals or orders. If associated records exist, a `400 Bad Request` error is returned.
  
  #### Headers
  - `Authorization: Bearer <token>` (Inherited)
  
  #### Response (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "message": "Job deleted successfully"
    },
    "message": "Job deleted successfully"
  }
  ```
}
